{"c":[{"id":"176e1e47f3b7f3ae","sum":"comments may change (#128 @rel, 0001+0007); SQL must not. make ci compares comments-stripped SQL to the latest tag. 2.0.0 no vss, HNSW: CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW: FatalException; close checkpoints. 0004-0009, mid-chain kill, tiny checkpoint_threshold reach 9.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T040809Z-c22f9b609db9aad0","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: a released migration may gain or change comments (#128 added @rel lines to 0001 and 0007); its SQL may never change to do something materially different. A make ci/CI gate compares released migrations' SQL, comments stripped, to the latest tag.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T042410Z-e369216e79b70d78","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 without vss, file with the HNSW index (2026-10-22): explicit CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW raises FatalException (Cannot bind index); a plain close checkpoints fine. Runner 0004-0009, a kill mid-chain, tiny checkpoint_threshold: all reach 9.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"906dad0df1fa4bd0","sum":"New warehouse is renamed into place under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 tests use DuckDB 1.5.4 vss files. v1.0.0 view SQL has one fewer closing paren than v2.0.0; do not compare view SQL text. Table SQL and constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T141155Z-466f715437dd59f5","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a new warehouse is built at a temp name and renamed into place after a check under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 migrate tests use files written by DuckDB 1.5.4 and its vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T143437Z-5511efe16b6ad9f6","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-23: a v1.0.0 file reloads view SQL (duckdb_views().sql) with one fewer closing paren than memory or a v2.0.0 file shows for the same view; table SQL and constraints match. A v1.0.0-vs-v2.0.0 catalog check must not compare view SQL text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
